rce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009860/extras/10d699be951ee117d9b759e19fcc2855.mp4?t=1729049475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i><strong>Assemble a team of minions</strong></i> and utilize their diverse abilities to navigate and escape intricate mazes<br></li><li><i><strong>Customize and upgrade your minions</strong></i> with a variety of upgrades and abilities to enhance their performance<br></li><li><i><strong>Combine minions</strong></i> to create more formidable versions and discover powerful combinations of abilities<br></li><li><i><strong>Collect powerful relics</strong></i> to further enhance your runs and make each playthrough unique<br></li><li><i><strong>Uncover hidden secrets</strong></i>, including new minions and relics, as you progress through the game<br></li><li><i><strong>Experience a different challenge each time</strong></i> with procedurally generated mazes<br></li><li>Earn accomplishments and showcase your skills with <i><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></i><br></li><li>Save your progress and pick up where you left off with <i><strong>Steam Cloud Saves</strong></i></li></ul><br>Manage your minions to build the perfect wave!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009860/extras/fc2ae295aba8321e54b11837d68c2f95.poster.avif?t=1729049475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009860/extras/fc2ae295aba8321e54b11837d68c2f95.webm?t=1729049475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009860/extras/fc2ae295aba8321e54b11837d68c2f95.mp4?t=1729049475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
